AccountsCoverageOut.description:
Whether filed accounts are on record for one company and, when none is, why
in one plain sentence. state is on_record, nothing_found or source_not_covered;
reason is the matrix reason (or no_country) for source_not_covered.

EventAttrsOut.description:
The citation-safe stored-attr subset the headline templates and citation
verbs read (register-stated identifiers and the G3 filing page link only;
never a payload passthrough).

OwnershipCoverageOut.description:
The coverage verdict: the product's honest per-node answer to "can this
graph be relied on for beneficial ownership". Deterministic, zero LLM;
tokens are the chain_coverage vocabulary, wording renders verbatim.
